  "title": "Erdős Problem #531",
  "statement": {
    "representation": "markdown-latex",
    "text": "Let $F(k)$ be the minimal $N$ such that if we two-colour $\\{1,\\ldots,N\\}$ there is a set $A$ of size $k$ such that all subset sums $\\sum_{a\\in S}a$ (for $\\emptyset\neq S\\subseteq A$) are monochromatic. Estimate $F(k)$.",
